 "ui_copy": {
  "briefing": {
   "id": "nar_m02_ui_briefing",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_ui_briefing",
   "source_text": "The migration moves today, and the seven inherited accounts disagree about the ground. Hold the route, root the Waystone at the anchor the founding decision left, and bring the memory bearer to the account site.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 260,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  "objectives": [
   {
    "id": "nar_m02_ui_obj_root_waystone",
    "loc_key": "nar_m02_ui_obj_root_waystone",
    "source_text": "Uproot the Waystone and root it at the inherited route anchor.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "text_budget": {
     "max_characters": 102,
     "localization_expansion_percent": 30
    },
    "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
   },
   {
    "id": "nar_m02_ui_obj_recall_memory",
    "loc_key": "nar_m02_ui_obj_recall_memory",
    "source_text": "Bring the memory bearer to the account site while the route holds.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "text_budget": {
     "max_characters": 106,
     "localization_expansion_percent": 30
    },
    "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
   }
  ]
 },
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_orders_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_orders_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Seven accounts of this basin, and no two agree where the ground will hold. We walk the route my predecessors argue about.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 161,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_op_orders_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_accounts_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_accounts_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The third account says rain cut the western shelf. The fifth says the shelf never existed. Both of them are certain. I have learned to be neither.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 186,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_op_accounts_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_waystone_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_waystone_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Uproot the Waystone and carry it to the anchor the founding decision left us. The route we inherited decides where we may stand.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 168,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_op_waystone_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_stakes_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_stakes_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The herds move today whether we are ready or not. A migration route is only a route while someone holds it open.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 152,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_op_stakes_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_humor_005",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_op_humor_005",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "My second account insists this ridge is a riverbed. If we drown on dry stone, it will at least settle one family argument.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 162,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_op_humor_005",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_confirm_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_confirm_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_waystone_rooted",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Waystone is rooted at the anchor. The ground agrees with at least one of my accounts. Progress, of a kind.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 150,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_rooted_confirm_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_bearer_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_bearer_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_waystone_rooted",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Now the bearer walks. The account site is close, and the accounts that survive are the ones a living witness carries.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 157,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_rooted_bearer_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_terrain_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_terrain_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_waystone_rooted",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Watch the route edges. Whatever the accounts disagree on, hostile ground is a fact we can all verify together.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 150,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_rooted_terrain_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_memory_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_rooted_memory_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_waystone_rooted",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "What we recall at the site will not settle which account was true. It will only add an eighth. That is how memory works here.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 165,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_rooted_memory_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_recall_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_recall_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_memory_recalled",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The bearer stands at the account site. The recall is made, and the route held long enough to make it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 141,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_complete_recall_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_accounts_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_accounts_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_memory_recalled",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Seven accounts disagreed about this ground. We have not proven any of them right. We have proven the route can still be walked.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 167,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_complete_accounts_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_forward_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_complete_forward_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_memory_recalled",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The herds pass. The Waystone holds. I will argue with my predecessors about the rest on the way home.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 141,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_complete_forward_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_core_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_core_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The command core is gone. Without it there is no authority to hold the route open. The migration finds another way, or does not.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 168,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_fail_core_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_bearer_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_bearer_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The memory bearer is lost. An account that reaches no witness is not recalled. This attempt ends here.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 142,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_fail_bearer_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_waystone_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_waystone_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Waystone is destroyed. Without it the route has no anchor, and the accounts have nothing to argue over.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 147,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_fail_waystone_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_terminal_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_terminal_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The engagement has gone terminal. Whatever the accounts say about this ground, no one holds it now.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 139,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m02_vo_fail_terminal_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_generic_005",
   "loc_key": "nar_m02_line_oruun_fail_generic_005",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m02_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The operation has failed. The route closes behind us. We will read the accounts again and return.",
   "placeholders": {},
